  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Reflection class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use mirror power a psionic manifestion you create a 30 ft. zone of psionic energy shimmering around you. Your reflections resonate with psionic characters within your zone allowing them a circumstance bonus to their manifester level equal to the number of rounds you have echoed one of their powers. This bonus lasts a maximum number of rounds equal to your Charisma bonus.</p>\n<p>For more on Zones, see Transcendent 10—Psionics of Conflict: Zones of Power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
